    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "https://www.auctioneera.ie/property/8-the-green-tramore-road-ballyphehane-cork-t12-h5c1\r\nImportant note: Details of upcoming viewings and latest offers are available at the Auctioneera website link above.\r\n\r\nAuctioneera is delighted to present 8 The Green, Tramore Road, Ballyphehane.\r\n\r\nNestled in the heart of Ballyphehane, this is a charming semi-detached property that combines comfort and practicality. The home exhibits a traditional architectural style, complemented by a gravel driveway that provides ample parking space. The private side entrance is a notable feature, granting easy access to the slabbed back garden, perfect for outdoor leisure or simple relaxation.\r\n\r\nAs you step inside, the ground floor reveals a well-proportioned living room, featuring a sizeable window that floods the space with natural light. The kitchen is functional and designed for practicality, with a layout conducive to everyday use. The dining area, positioned adjacent to the kitchen, is ideal for family meals and gatherings. This floor also features two generously sized bedrooms. Each bedroom offers space for essential furnishings, with windows that invite ample light and pleasant views of the surroundings. The bathroom is centrally located on this floor and equipped to meet the family's needs.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property features a versatile bedroom that can be used as a comfortable guest room or a practical home office, offering flexibility to suit your lifestyle.\r\n\r\nLocated on the Tramore Road, this area benefits from excellent transport links, with bus stops within a short walking distance providing easy access to Cork city centre and other key destinations. The vicinity is well-served by local amenities including shops, schools, and sports clubs, making it a convenient and attractive choice for families.\r\n\r\nThe property’s unique blend of space, practical layout, and location make it an ideal choice for first-time buyers seeking a foothold in a vibrant community or investors looking for a promising rental opportunity. Its proximity to essential services and easy commuting options also enhances its appeal as an excellent residential opportunity."
      },
